even-pages-header-story-hash:0: set qr to get story range boundDoc story type even pages header story
even-pages-header-story-hash:1: set recoveryTask to current application's NSTask's alloc()'s init()
even-pages-header-story-hash:2: recoveryTask's setLaunchPath:"/usr/bin/shasum"
even-pages-header-story-hash:3: recoveryTask's setArguments:{"-a", "256"}
even-pages-header-story-hash:4: set recoveryInput to current application's NSPipe's pipe()
even-pages-header-story-hash:5: set recoveryOutput to current application's NSPipe's pipe()
even-pages-header-story-hash:6: recoveryTask's setStandardInput:recoveryInput
even-pages-header-story-hash:7: recoveryTask's setStandardOutput:recoveryOutput
even-pages-header-story-hash:8: recoveryTask's setStandardError:(current application's NSFileHandle's fileHandleWithNullDevice())
even-pages-header-story-hash:9: set recoveryData to (current application's NSString's stringWithString:(content of qr as text))'s dataUsingEncoding:4
even-pages-header-story-hash:10: recoveryTask's |launch|()
even-pages-header-story-hash:11: (recoveryInput's fileHandleForWriting())'s writeData:recoveryData
even-pages-header-story-hash:12: (recoveryInput's fileHandleForWriting())'s closeFile()
even-pages-header-story-hash:13: set recoveryDigestData to (recoveryOutput's fileHandleForReading())'s readDataToEndOfFile()
even-pages-header-story-hash:14: recoveryTask's waitUntilExit()
even-pages-header-story-hash:15: if (recoveryTask's terminationStatus() as integer) is not 0 then error "WPSC_CHECKPOINT_HASH_FAILED"
even-pages-header-story-hash:16: set recoveryDigestText to (current application's NSString's alloc()'s initWithData:recoveryDigestData |encoding|:4) as text
even-pages-header-story-hash:17: if (length of recoveryDigestText) is not 68 then error "WPSC_CHECKPOINT_HASH_FAILED"
even-pages-header-story-hash:18: if text 65 thru 68 of recoveryDigestText is not "  -" & linefeed then error "WPSC_CHECKPOINT_HASH_FAILED"
even-pages-header-story-hash:19: set probePartHash to text 1 thru 64 of recoveryDigestText
even-pages-header-story-hash:20: set probeRows to {{"story-hash",probePartHash,(count fields of qr)}}

